WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.666 --> 00:00:31.416
In verse 13.24,

2
00:00:31.416 --> 00:00:33.083
Lord Krishna explains

3
00:00:33.083 --> 00:00:36.708
the supreme benefit of understanding
 the relationship

4
00:00:36.708 --> 00:00:38.625
between the soul, the Paramatma,

5
00:00:38.625 --> 00:00:40.458
and material nature.

6
00:00:40.458 --> 00:00:42.416
He says that the person who

7
00:00:42.416 --> 00:00:45.000
fully understands this knowledge

8
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:46.916
is certain of liberation.

9
00:00:46.916 --> 00:00:48.666
They will never take birth

10
00:00:48.666 --> 00:00:51.041
in the material world again.

11
00:00:55.416 --> 00:00:59.541
Lord Krishna says, ‘prakritim ca gunaih saha’.

12
00:00:59.541 --> 00:01:03.000
This means that the person who
truly understands prakriti,

13
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:06.125
that is - material nature,

14
00:01:06.125 --> 00:01:08.333
and the gunas, the three

15
00:01:08.333 --> 00:01:09.750
qualities of nature,

16
00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:13.208
and the purusha, the jivatma,

17
00:01:13.208 --> 00:01:17.250
is freed from the cycle of birth and death.

18
00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:19.083
Understanding the relationship between

19
00:01:19.083 --> 00:01:22.041
the jivatma, prakriti, and the Paramatma

20
00:01:22.041 --> 00:01:24.083
brings true liberation.

21
00:01:24.083 --> 00:01:26.333
The jivatma is the one bound

22
00:01:26.333 --> 00:01:28.458
within the material body.

23
00:01:28.458 --> 00:01:29.833
The Paramatma is the witness

24
00:01:29.833 --> 00:01:33.208
and permission-giver.

25
00:01:33.208 --> 00:01:36.291
Sarvatha vartamano'pi, that is -

26
00:01:36.291 --> 00:01:38.041
even a person whose soul is liberated

27
00:01:38.041 --> 00:01:41.291
is not bound by their material identity.

28
00:01:41.291 --> 00:01:43.291
Even while engaged in worldly activities,

29
00:01:43.291 --> 00:01:45.833
they remain unaffected.

30
00:01:45.833 --> 00:01:48.166
Understand this through the example

31
00:01:48.166 --> 00:01:49.916
of a good teacher.

32
00:01:49.916 --> 00:01:52.708
Students come to them with the joys,

33
00:01:52.708 --> 00:01:56.083
sorrows, achievements, and
mistakes of their lives,

34
00:01:56.083 --> 00:01:58.291
seeking guidance.

35
00:01:58.291 --> 00:02:02.166
The teacher guides them as best they can, but

36
00:02:02.166 --> 00:02:04.166
they are not themselves affected

37
00:02:04.166 --> 00:02:06.041
by the students' joy or sorrow.

38
00:02:06.041 --> 00:02:07.791
In the same way, the jivatma,

39
00:02:07.791 --> 00:02:10.000
when it understands that its true

40
00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:13.291
existence is beyond the temporary
material world,

41
00:02:13.291 --> 00:02:15.041
it no longer becomes internally

42
00:02:15.041 --> 00:02:17.541
entangled in material activities

43
00:02:17.541 --> 00:02:19.208
and naturally

44
00:02:19.208 --> 00:02:21.708
attains vairagya, detachment.

45
00:02:21.708 --> 00:02:25.250
A person of knowledge, even while
living amidst worldly activity,

46
00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:28.541
sees everything from the
perspective of knowledge.

47
00:02:28.541 --> 00:02:30.750
They remain unaffected by the duality

48
00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:32.750
of joy and sorrow.

49
00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:35.000
This is the true purpose of knowledge,

50
00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:37.000
liberation from the cycle of the world

51
00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:41.041
and return to one's original spiritual nature.

52
00:02:45.833 --> 00:02:48.416
Do not consider your present

53
00:02:48.416 --> 00:02:51.416
situation as everything.

54
00:02:51.416 --> 00:02:52.916
You may be experiencing

55
00:02:52.916 --> 00:02:57.375
restlessness right now,

56
00:02:57.375 --> 00:03:01.625
about your role, or a life that feels

57
00:03:01.625 --> 00:03:06.125
repetitive and dull.

58
00:03:06.125 --> 00:03:08.166
But remember,

59
00:03:08.166 --> 00:03:09.750
your present

60
00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:12.791
does not define your future.

61
00:03:12.791 --> 00:03:15.875
In this verse I say,

62
00:03:15.875 --> 00:03:19.333
even if a person lives

63
00:03:19.333 --> 00:03:24.125
in this world surrounded by challenges,
if they understand the truth,

64
00:03:24.125 --> 00:03:28.000
who they are, what this world is,

65
00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:32.666
and how I am present within all of this,

66
00:03:32.666 --> 00:03:35.541
they are no longer bound,

67
00:03:35.541 --> 00:03:38.208
they become free.

68
00:03:38.208 --> 00:03:40.708
True transformation begins not from outside,

69
00:03:40.708 --> 00:03:42.833
but from within.

70
00:03:42.833 --> 00:03:44.291
The moment

71
00:03:44.291 --> 00:03:48.750
you understand how this material nature

72
00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:51.625
pulls you toward itself

73
00:03:51.625 --> 00:03:55.166
and how your soul is separate from it,

74
00:03:55.166 --> 00:03:58.250
from that very moment you stop

75
00:03:58.250 --> 00:04:01.416
unnecessary mental churning.

76
00:04:01.416 --> 00:04:05.083
You step back, observe,

77
00:04:05.083 --> 00:04:07.916
and make meaningful choices.

78
00:04:07.916 --> 00:04:11.166
To be free, you do not need a different job,

79
00:04:11.166 --> 00:04:12.375
different people,

80
00:04:12.375 --> 00:04:15.500
or a different city,

81
00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:20.708
but a different perspective.

82
00:04:20.708 --> 00:04:23.000
This is the power of knowledge.

83
00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:26.375
It does not erase your past,

84
00:04:26.375 --> 00:04:30.291
but it reshapes your future.

85
00:04:30.291 --> 00:04:31.916
So

86
00:04:31.916 --> 00:04:35.125
if your present circumstances are not ideal,

87
00:04:35.125 --> 00:04:38.083
do not be disturbed.

88
00:04:38.083 --> 00:04:40.916
Because where you are right now

89
00:04:40.916 --> 00:04:45.000
is only one chapter of your life,

90
00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:47.416
not the final conclusion.

91
00:04:47.416 --> 00:04:51.083
Patience and true understanding will

92
00:04:51.083 --> 00:04:54.333
always keep moving you forward

93
00:04:54.333 --> 00:04:55.791
on the path of liberation.

94
00:05:00.583 --> 00:05:03.583
When you hear the word 'liberation,'

95
00:05:03.583 --> 00:05:05.375
you may think

96
00:05:05.375 --> 00:05:09.916
it is only possible after death.

97
00:05:09.916 --> 00:05:12.125
But that is not so.

98
00:05:12.125 --> 00:05:17.083
Liberation can begin today, right now.

99
00:05:17.083 --> 00:05:20.208
If you are caught in a cycle

100
00:05:20.208 --> 00:05:23.083
of repeated mistakes, misunderstandings,

101
00:05:23.083 --> 00:05:27.250
or emotional entanglements within the family,

102
00:05:27.250 --> 00:05:31.958
and you find a way out of it,

103
00:05:31.958 --> 00:05:36.708
understand that liberation has begun.

104
00:05:36.708 --> 00:05:40.000
In this verse I say,

105
00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:42.625
even while living in this world

106
00:05:42.625 --> 00:05:46.083
and remaining busy with daily life,

107
00:05:46.083 --> 00:05:49.666
if someone gains the right knowledge,

108
00:05:49.666 --> 00:05:54.416
how the world works, who they truly are,

109
00:05:54.416 --> 00:05:58.375
and how they are connected to Me,

110
00:05:58.375 --> 00:06:01.666
they can be free.

111
00:06:01.666 --> 00:06:03.708
This is not freedom

112
00:06:03.708 --> 00:06:06.916
from responsibilities, but

113
00:06:06.916 --> 00:06:10.208
freedom from illusion and confusion.

114
00:06:10.208 --> 00:06:13.958
Problems will come to your home,

115
00:06:13.958 --> 00:06:19.291
disagreements, the stress of parenting,
financial worries.

116
00:06:19.291 --> 00:06:24.625
But when you have spiritual clarity,

117
00:06:24.625 --> 00:06:27.875
you stop reacting

118
00:06:27.875 --> 00:06:29.833
on impulse.

119
00:06:29.833 --> 00:06:32.375
You pause, reflect,

120
00:06:32.375 --> 00:06:34.333
and ask,

121
00:06:34.333 --> 00:06:37.375
'What is truly happening here?

122
00:06:37.375 --> 00:06:40.875
Am I seeing the full picture?'

123
00:06:40.875 --> 00:06:44.041
Knowledge gives you that perspective,

124
00:06:44.041 --> 00:06:46.625
to see beyond the surface,

125
00:06:46.625 --> 00:06:52.041
and to respond with wisdom
rather than frustration.

126
00:06:52.041 --> 00:06:53.750
And gradually,

127
00:06:53.750 --> 00:06:55.708
your family life

128
00:06:55.708 --> 00:06:59.625
does not just cope with challenges, but

129
00:06:59.625 --> 00:07:02.833
also grows through them.

130
00:07:02.833 --> 00:07:05.375
This is true liberation,

131
00:07:05.375 --> 00:07:09.625
not escaping from your life, but

132
00:07:09.625 --> 00:07:12.333
living it with awareness.

133
00:07:16.916 --> 00:07:18.958
Remember,

134
00:07:18.958 --> 00:07:23.250
one of the most powerful truths is

135
00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:25.000
that your past

136
00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:28.291
does not define your future.

137
00:07:28.291 --> 00:07:31.541
In professional life, you may be stuck

138
00:07:31.541 --> 00:07:34.833
in a difficult project,

139
00:07:34.833 --> 00:07:38.166
working in an immature team,

140
00:07:38.166 --> 00:07:39.583
or feeling that

141
00:07:39.583 --> 00:07:43.541
your growth has stopped.

142
00:07:43.541 --> 00:07:48.166
But if you gain the right knowledge

143
00:07:48.166 --> 00:07:52.708
and apply it, everything can change.

144
00:07:52.708 --> 00:07:56.500
This is what I say in this verse,

145
00:07:56.500 --> 00:08:00.583
even if you remain in the same
external environment,

146
00:08:00.583 --> 00:08:04.625
if you understand how prakriti works,

147
00:08:04.625 --> 00:08:05.750
the nature of the soul,

148
00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:09.583
and your relationship with Me,

149
00:08:09.583 --> 00:08:14.666
you become free from confusion and pressure.

150
00:08:14.666 --> 00:08:16.583
This is true liberation.

151
00:08:16.583 --> 00:08:20.250
In your workplace, this means,

152
00:08:20.250 --> 00:08:24.416
not seeing yourself as weak, and moving

153
00:08:24.416 --> 00:08:28.083
out of adversity with clarity.

154
00:08:28.083 --> 00:08:30.958
Instead of saying 'Why is this happening to me?'

155
00:08:30.958 --> 00:08:35.666
you begin to ask,

156
00:08:35.666 --> 00:08:38.333
'What can I learn from this?'

157
00:08:38.333 --> 00:08:39.708
You understand

158
00:08:39.708 --> 00:08:42.875
that results come not only from effort,

159
00:08:42.875 --> 00:08:47.000
but also from inner awareness.

160
00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:49.458
When you understand

161
00:08:49.458 --> 00:08:54.500
that you are not merely an employee
or a designation,

162
00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:57.916
but a conscious soul,

163
00:08:57.916 --> 00:09:02.833
your perspective toward problems changes.

164
00:09:02.833 --> 00:09:05.083
You stop getting caught in office politics

165
00:09:05.083 --> 00:09:10.541
or the ups and downs of frustration.

166
00:09:10.541 --> 00:09:13.416
You begin to lead with steadiness,

167
00:09:13.416 --> 00:09:17.125
listening to the voice within.

168
00:09:17.125 --> 00:09:18.416
So

169
00:09:18.416 --> 00:09:22.583
do not wait for the world to change.

170
00:09:22.583 --> 00:09:25.000
Let your understanding change,

171
00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:29.208
and your world will follow.

172
00:09:29.208 --> 00:09:32.625
This is how you rise,

173
00:09:32.625 --> 00:09:35.666
and this is true success.
